sub alias | Create command shortcuts
sub api | Make an authenticated HTTP request to a shithub API endpoint
sub attestation | Verify and inspect Sigstore artifact attestations (deferred
sub auth | Authenticate shithub-cli and configure git credential helper
sub browse | Open the shithub repository in a browser
sub cache | Manage GitHub-Actions-compatible cache entries
sub completion | Print a shell completion script
sub config | Read and write shithub-cli configuration
sub extension | Install and manage third-party shithub-cli extensions
sub gist | Manage gists (deferred until shithub-S49 ships)
sub gpg-key | Manage your shithub GPG public keys
sub help | Help about any command
sub issue | Manage issues
sub label | Manage repository labels
sub org | Work with organizations
sub pr | Manage pull requests
sub project | Manage ProjectsV2-style projects (deferred until shithub-S47
sub release | Manage releases (deferred until shithub-S48 ships)
sub repo | Manage repositories
sub ruleset | Inspect repository and org rulesets (deferred until REST API
sub run | Inspect workflow runs and their artifacts
sub search | Search across repos, issues, PRs, code, and commits
sub secret | Manage GitHub-Actions-style secrets
sub ssh-key | Manage your shithub SSH public keys
sub status | Personal dashboard: assigned issues, PRs, review requests, m
sub variable | Manage GitHub-Actions-style variables
sub version | Print version information
sub workflow | Inspect and trigger GitHub-Actions-style workflows
flag -h --help | help for shithub
flag -v --version | version for shithub
